; Grid-stride KernelContext loop: thread ids become intrinsics, FloatArray calls array ops, the loop variable a block argument.
; RUN: tc-java --no-loc target/test-classes uk.ac.manchester.tornado.tc.frontend.kernels.C3Kernels.add | FileCheck %s
